from pathlib import Path
import ast,hashlib,shutil
root=Path.cwd();active=root/'PAFPlayer.py'
notes=root/'releases/PAFPlayer_v762_late_preview_handoff_release_notes.md';assert not notes.exists()
notes.write_text('# PAFPlayer V762 — pause peers at the audible handoff\n\nSimple previews register during setup without claiming audio focus. The buffered renderer starts in hold-for-handoff mode and primes silently while other players continue. Once primed, the preview acquires acknowledged pauses and immediately releases its prepared output. The FFplay fallback acquires focus immediately before process launch, after command and environment preparation.\n\nA failed silent preparation stops its renderer and leaves peer focus untouched until a fallback is ready. Focus/output-start failures stop the held renderer and propagate through normal cleanup, without launching a competing decoder. Existing pause ownership and originally paused/stopped players remain protected. Registering early preserves priority for overlapping silent startups; startup pause latches are refreshed after focus waiting so a previously held preview can actually start.\n\n33 focused tests passed, including the actual playback routine with simulated renderers: creation/priming/claim/output ordering, FFplay timing, preparation fallback, failed focus/output starts, stale startup pause latch, peer acknowledgement and all prior pause/startup ownership regressions. No live player was paused or interrupted for testing.\n',encoding='utf-8')
release=root/'releases/PAFPlayer_v762_late_preview_handoff.py';assert not release.exists();shutil.copy2(active,release)
assert hashlib.sha256(active.read_bytes()).digest()==hashlib.sha256(release.read_bytes()).digest()
for path in (active,release,root/'tests/test_v762_late_handoff.py'):ast.parse(path.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
report=root/'tests/reports/v762-late-handoff-checks.txt';assert not report.exists()
report.write_text('V762 late audible handoff verification\n\nExecuted: python -B -m unittest test_v762_late_handoff.HandoffTests test_v755_preview_focus test_v759_pause_ownership test_v758_simple_startup.StartupTests\nResult: 33 tests passed in 9.239 seconds.\n\nActual playback routine exercised with simulated silent/buffered and legacy renderers. Checked creation -> priming -> focus claim -> audible release, late FFplay launch, failed preparation fallback, focus/output failure cleanup and startup pause latch refresh. Existing peer acknowledgement, pause ownership and concurrent startup regressions passed.\nSyntax and release SHA256 checks passed. Single-file feature modules unchanged. Root audit retained active data/implementation/Qwen shim and lockscreen/screensaver native inputs and runtime assets. No C:\\BAT changes. Live playback was not interrupted.\n',encoding='utf-8')
print('V762 packaged; syntax and standalone release hash checks passed.')
